OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and breezy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. A bright and sunny afternoon
OL,8,Ffor many as cloud clears and wind
OL,9,Feases by early afternoon, but cloud
OL,10,Fmay linger along coasts. Feeling warm
OL,11,Fin the sunshine.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAfter a dry and clear
OL,14,Fevening, showers move in from the
OL,15,Fsouthwest for a time. Cooler
OL,16,Ftemperatures and light winds allow
OL,17,Fsome mist or fog patches to form by
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
