OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA clear morning, clouds
OL,6,Fforming and the wind strengthening by
OL,7,Fthe afternoon, though remaining dry.
OL,8,FTemperatures staying above average.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FClear
OL,11,Fstart to Friday, cloudy periods later.
OL,12,FCloudy periods and possibly wet in
OL,13,Fplaces on Saturday. Some fog patches
OL,14,FSunday morning, sunny spells to
OL,15,Ffollow. Temperatures remain above the
OL,16,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
